  "notes": "Two-storey white/cream house (#ece7db) with a red-brown tile gable roof (#8a4a34, darker than neighbours). A timber gabled carport/porch (#8a5a2f) projects on the right, its bay open to a garage stacked with boxes. Frontage is a tall smooth white solid wall (#f2efe8) with a matching white panel pedestrian gate and a twin-globe lamp post at the kerb; brick-paved forecourt, a purple Peugeot 307 parked on the drive, palms and a rounded hedge. Environment: purple hatchback on the brick drive, two tall palms + a smaller palm, a rounded oak, a dense mass of green bushes on the right, grass-filled planters, twin-globe lamp, green bin at the corner. Sampled colours 2026-07-04."
